WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
DARKO version 1.2.3, with the production DARKO Charts Beta connection.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Compare the first six 2022 draft picks over their first 200 played NBA games.

00:12.000 --> 00:20.600
The six-player chart uses Modern styling with a white background.

00:20.600 --> 00:28.350
Change the metric to defensive DPM and the range to ages 19–25.

00:28.350 --> 00:39.740
Choose a square export, smoothing span 0.6 and smoothed-peak labels; download the 2x PNG.

00:39.740 --> 00:52.390
Game 1 means the rating before the first played NBA game. Chet's debut rating differs from his earlier opening estimate.

00:52.390 --> 00:58.390
The actual downloaded square PNG, 2400 by 2400 pixels.

00:58.390 --> 00:66.390
DARKO explains that this integration supports NBA players and cannot supply WNBA histories.
